<title>POLAND: NFI units close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>NFI units close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish mass privatisation NFI units fell 1.6 percent to 94 zlotys in Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Monday.</p>
<p>Shares in three companies closed flat in the continuous trade. Debica and Rolimpex did not trade. Total turnover fell to 79,800 zlotys from 301,250 million zlotys on Friday.</p>
<p>WSECONT. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
